  "instructions": [
    "In a medium bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, garlic, sumac, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the flaked tuna to the bowl and toss to coat with the dressing.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix together the labneh and chopped ferment-kimchi.",
    "To assemble the bowls, divide the labneh mixture between two bowls.",
    "Top the labneh with the tuna mixture.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "Refrigerate any leftovers for up to 24 hours."
